---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Version: preview
Date: 2026-11-03
  Features:
    - Added specific archivation approaches (.tar.gz, .tar.xz). (#210)
    - Added configurable labeling types (`--labeling`, `--labeling-relative-to`, `--labeling-samples`, `--labeling-seed`). (#223)
  Minor Features:
    - Added color ratio shade computation utility for GraphVizPorter. (#222)
  Minor Changes:
    - Now the default archivation is .tar.xz instead of .zip. (#210)
    - Removed zip archivation approach. (#210)
    - Removed `--max-labeling` and `--no-partial-labeling` in favour of `--labeling`. (#223)
  Bugfixes:
    - Fixed a possible crash when sharing a graph with multiple processes. (#222)
